        "scope": "test fixture corrected to exercise feature-lineage mismatch branch"
      }
    ],
    "implemented": [
      "Walk-forward source clusters derive from the observed target record's canonical publisher lineage.",
      "Multi-publisher target aggregates remain unclustered rather than being assigned arbitrarily.",
      "Paired moving-block bootstrap accepts explicit confidence levels and reports the actual level.",
      "Forecast readiness policy v5 requires temporal and source-clustered intervals in out-of-sample and shadow cohorts.",
      "Four baseline comparisons and two loss metrics are covered by 95% Bonferroni familywise control; individual interval confidence is at least 99.375%.",
      "At least 100 paired origins, 10,000 bootstrap replicates, five receipt-backed source clusters and two target origins per cluster are required.",
      "All adjusted interval upper bounds must be below zero for both Brier and log loss against every baseline.",
      "Source-cluster IDs must match the count and be a subset of declared and raw-receipt source groups.",
      "Minimum dataset independent source-group count raised to five; mission JSON copies synchronized."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Outcome-source clustering does not establish independence among model-training feature sources.",
      "The new tests use synthetic fixtures and do not demonstrate XRP predictive performance.",
      "No trained XRP-specific candidate model exists.",
      "The historical XRP repository data includes one large snapshot JSON dated 2026-10-28, not a complete synchronized time series.",
      "The main-only ingestion workflow has not executed on main.",
      "No independent WORM archive or trusted timestamp anchor exists."
    ]
  },
